# Local scratch
shot.mjs
# Rendered site and scratch backtest output are artifacts of a run, never
# checked in — a committed report is one that eventually goes stale while still
# looking authoritative. `docs/backtest.json` is the deliberate exception: the
# daily session republishes the site and needs the last result to render from.
site/
/backtest.json
!docs/backtest.json
